| `georgia` | Georgia state agency override |

## How to Generate

```python
from capability_statement_generator import generate_capability_statement

generate_capability_statement(
    sector='janitorial',
    agency_name='Defense Commissary Agency — Fort Bragg',
    solicitation_number='HQC00526QE011',
    output_path='BIDS:RESOURCES/DECA FORT BRAGG LANDSCAPING/SEND_TO_BUYER/HQC00526QE011_Landscaping_Capability_Statement.html',
)
```

## Parameters

| Parameter | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `sector` | YES | Sector key from table above |
| `agency_name` | YES | Full agency name for footer |
| `solicitation_number` | YES | Solicitation number for footer |
| `output_path` | YES | Path to save the HTML file |
| `custom_overview` | Optional | Override the default sector overview text |
| `custom_competencies` | Optional | Override competency grid cards |
| `custom_service_capabilities` | Optional | Override service capability bullet list |
| `custom_differentiators` | Optional | Override differentiator list |
| `custom_past_performance` | Optional | Override past performance cards |
| `custom_naics_detailed` | Optional | Override NAICS code pills |

## Why This Exists

Dee has corrected this multiple times. Cap statements were being hand-built with wrong fonts, wrong colors, wrong layouts, and inconsistent branding. The generator system exists specifically to prevent this. Use it.
